イバーへの返礼品、ネップリを含む商用利用 ※グッズ化を除く）\nサイン、イラスト、背景のレイヤー分けをいただいたpsd形式も頂けますと嬉しいです。\n\nリクエスト金額の不足や不備がございましたら、お手数ですが再送依頼をお願いいたします。\nリクエストをお受けいただけますと嬉しいです。よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1XEkq-squU8Zxsah6jZcxhkyOSyIWnmlu?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 856326, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "zanki0.1", "screen_name": "zanki_404", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1774658916221370369/soASllrw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1377123323860066304/1711899249/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 1490286, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "八束穂", "screen_name": "yatukaho_Epi", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1609809173751173125/pKeskkzg.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1394645233/1672643432/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 17}, {"id": 3391870, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "：", "screen_name": "lnhr_824", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1881341018207113216/sNreKze2.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"